        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer BB5010-356, 3-1/2\" x 6\"  Wide Throw Steel Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes one (1) complete hinge with matching finish steel flathead, Phillips Drive #10 x 1\" wood screws and 10-24 x 1/2\" machine screws. Standard full mortise hinge with 5 knuckle design and button tips with ball bearings. BHMA certified architectural grade hinges. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BOM-BB5010-356-size.gif?v=1704442293\" width=\"600\" height=\"308\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer BB5010-356 Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer BB5010-356 Steel Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.123\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Steel Pin</li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - Conforms to ANSI A8133 Hinges</li>\r\n<li>Package with matching finish machine screws and wood screws. For use with both metal and wood doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Special order item. Please allow 4 weeks to ship. <b>NO RETURNS</b></i>\r\n</p>",
